created":"2023-09-15T09:11:34.619+0000","updated":"2023-09-15T09:11:34.619+0000"}],"maxResults":32,"total":32,"startAt":0},"status":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/status/5","description":"A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.","iconUrl":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png","name":"Resolved","id":"5","statusCategory":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/statuscategory/3","id":3,"key":"done","colorName":"green","name":"Done"}}},"renderedFields":{"summary":null,"resolutiondate":"14/Sep/23 14:08","created":"14/Dec/18 19:51","description":"<p>KIP: <a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-405%3A+Kafka+Tiered+Storage\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-405%3A+Kafka+Tiered+Storage</a></p>\n\n<p>Next version of tiered storage is tracked at <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15420\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15420</a></p>","issuelinks":null,"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/16955233","id":"16955233","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=githubbot","name":"githubbot","key":"githubbot","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"ASF GitHub Bot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"body":"<p>satishd commented on pull request #7561: <span class=\"error\">&#91;WIP&#93;</span> <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-7739\" title=\"Kafka Tiered Storage\" class=\"issue-link\" data-issue-key=\"KAFKA-7739\"><del>KAFKA-7739</del></a>: Tiered storage<br/>\nURL: <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/7561\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/7561</a></p>\n\n\n<p>   <span class=\"error\">&#91;WIP&#93;</span> This is the initial *<b>draft</b>* version of the KIP-405. It includes the initial set of changes required for plugging in a RemoteStorageManager. We will update the KIP and this PR in the next few days with more details.</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li>\n\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t<li>Committer Checklist (excluded from commit message)</li>\n\t\t</ol>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ol>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>[ ] Verify design and implementation</li>\n\t<li>[ ] Verify test coverage and CI build status</li>\n\t<li>[ ] Verify documentation (including upgrade notes)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>----------------------------------------------------------------<br/>\nThis is an automated message from the Apache Git Service.<br/>\nTo respond to the message, please log on to GitHub and use the<br/>\nURL above to go to the specific comment.</p>\n\n<p>For queries about this service, please contact Infrastructure at:<br/>\nusers@infra.apache.org</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=githubbot","name":"githubbot","key":"githubbot","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"ASF GitHub Bot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"created":"19/Oct/19 17:55","updated":"19/Oct/19 17:55"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17377081","id":"17377081","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=kkonstantine","name":"kkonstantine","key":"kkonstantine","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Konstantine Karantasis","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> this issue is still open, yet you had requested for <a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-405%3A+Kafka+Tiered+Storage\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">KIP-405: Kafka Tiered Storage</a> to be included in the 3.0 AK release. Can you say if the set of resolved issues are sufficient to consider that KIP-405 is included in 3.0, or should I move the KIP to the list of postponed KIPs?</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=kkonstantine","name":"kkonstantine","key":"kkonstantine","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Konstantine Karantasis","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"created":"08/Jul/21 05:48","updated":"08/Jul/21 05:48"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17378276","id":"17378276","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=kkonstantine","name":"kkonstantine","key":"kkonstantine","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Konstantine Karantasis","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"body":"<p>Setting the target version of this feature to the next AK release (currently 3.1.0) since there are still essential parts of the implementation that haven't landed before feature freeze for 3.0</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=kkonstantine","name":"kkonstantine","key":"kkonstantine","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Konstantine Karantasis","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"created":"09/Jul/21 20:27","updated":"09/Jul/21 20:27"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17437338","id":"17437338","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"body":"<p>Moved the target version to 3.2.0 since there are still essential parts of the implementation to be done.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=dajac","name":"dajac","key":"dajac","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"David Jacot","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich"},"created":"02/Nov/21 12:58","updated":"02/Nov/21 12:58"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17504833","id":"17504833","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=pcless","name":"pcless","key":"pcless","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Pedro Cardoso Silva","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p>Hello,</p>\n\n<p>Any update on this feature? Is it reasonable to expect this to be released in v3.2.0</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=pcless","name":"pcless","key":"pcless","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Pedro Cardoso Silva","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"11/Mar/22 09:52","updated":"11/Mar/22 09:52"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17566504","id":"17566504","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jagsancio","name":"jagsancio","key":"jagsancio","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Jose Armando Garcia Sancio","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sriharsha\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"sriharsha\">sriharsha</a> , KIP-405 is marked for the 3.3.0 release. Were we able to meet the feature freeze date? Or do you want me to remove it from the 3.3.0 release?</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jagsancio","name":"jagsancio","key":"jagsancio","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Jose Armando Garcia Sancio","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles"},"created":"13/Jul/22 21:51","updated":"13/Jul/22 21:51"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17616235","id":"17616235","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=blodsbror","name":"blodsbror","key":"blodsbror","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Evan Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> How is this KIP moving along? 3.3.1 is released. Do you see any progress on it in the near future ?</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=blodsbror","name":"blodsbror","key":"blodsbror","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Evan Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"12/Oct/22 07:05","updated":"12/Oct/22 07:05"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17640324","id":"17640324","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"body":"<p>The plan is to finish major part of this feature in 3.5.0.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"created":"29/Nov/22 00:59","updated":"29/Nov/22 00:59"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17640344","id":"17640344","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p>Thanks for the update and all the work for this feature,  <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> !!</p>\n\n<p> </p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"29/Nov/22 02:27","updated":"29/Nov/22 02:27"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17653624","id":"17653624","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=twmb","name":"twmb","key":"twmb","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=34059","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=34059","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=34059","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=34059"},"displayName":"Travis Bischel","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p>Hi there, this work looks excellent. Can the KIP be updated to change earliest log start offset from -3 to -4 (since -3 was taken for max timestamp)?</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=twmb","name":"twmb","key":"twmb","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=34059","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=34059","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=34059","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=34059"},"displayName":"Travis Bischel","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"02/Jan/23 14:55","updated":"02/Jan/23 14:55"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17706237","id":"17706237","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=twmb\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"twmb\">twmb</a> , we already use -4 to indicate the earliest log start offset (local log start offset). Thanks.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"29/Mar/23 06:42","updated":"29/Mar/23 06:42"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17706496","id":"17706496","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=twmb","name":"twmb","key":"twmb","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=34059","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=34059","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=34059","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=34059"},"displayName":"Travis Bischel","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=showuon\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"showuon\">showuon</a> thanks. How does that affect the KIP? If I'm to use the KIP as a client author, currently, I'll implement something incorrectly.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=twmb","name":"twmb","key":"twmb","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=34059","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=34059","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=34059","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=34059"},"displayName":"Travis Bischel","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"29/Mar/23 16:03","updated":"29/Mar/23 16:03"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17710971","id":"17710971","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=twmb\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"twmb\">twmb</a> KIP is updated with the right value for earliest local log start offset. Thanks.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"created":"11/Apr/23 14:00","updated":"11/Apr/23 14:00"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17712586","id":"17712586","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=hcai%40pinterest.com","name":"hcai@pinterest.com","key":"hcai@pinterest.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Henry Cai","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> I saw this KIP is moved out of [3.5.0 release plan |<a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Release+Plan+3.5.0\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Release+Plan+3.5.0</a>], will any of 30ish resolved subtasks/fixes in this KIP appear in 3.5.0 branch?</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=hcai%40pinterest.com","name":"hcai@pinterest.com","key":"hcai@pinterest.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Henry Cai","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"15/Apr/23 00:41","updated":"15/Apr/23 00:41"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17712816","id":"17712816","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=hcai%40pinterest.com\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"hcai@pinterest.com\">hcai@pinterest.com</a> Some of the JIRAs that were done in 3.5 and a couple of them are in progress/review.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-9550\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-9550</a> <br/>\n<a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14466\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14466</a> <br/>\n<a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14495\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14495</a> <br/>\n<a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14685\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14685</a> <br/>\n<a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14850\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14850</a></p>\n\n<p>We are working on having an early access build in ~6-7 weeks time. </p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"created":"16/Apr/23 16:55","updated":"16/Apr/23 17:10"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17720936","id":"17720936","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> could you help clarifying the following:</p>\n\n<p>RemoteStorageManager#fetchIndex and RemoteStorageManager#fetchLogSegment state:</p>\n\n<p>&gt;      * @throws RemoteResourceNotFoundException when there are no resources associated with the given remoteLogSegmentMetadata.</p>\n\n<p>Though when fetching indexes: Transactional Index is optional. So when returning a response should it be null? or throw RemoteResourceNotFoundException?</p>\n\n<p>From the javadoc is unclear whether resources means a specific object/index or the whole segment log + metadata.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"created":"09/May/23 13:42","updated":"09/May/23 13:42"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17720947","id":"17720947","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=adupriez","name":"adupriez","key":"adupriez","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782"},"displayName":"Alexandre Dupriez","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"body":"<p>I would think that the absence of the log segment or any mandatory ancillary file results in the stated exception. I think only transaction indexes are optional.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=adupriez","name":"adupriez","key":"adupriez","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782"},"displayName":"Alexandre Dupriez","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"created":"09/May/23 14:04","updated":"09/May/23 14:04"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17720955","id":"17720955","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"body":"<p>Yes, we know transactional index is optional when copying but not when fetching. I agree throwing the exception should be correct, but the javadoc is ambiguous as it refers to \"no resources associated with the given remoteLogSegmentMetadata\" that may mean <em>all</em> resources, instead of \"the requested resource is not found in the remote storage\" or similar.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"created":"09/May/23 15:00","updated":"09/May/23 15:00"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17721025","id":"17721025","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=adupriez","name":"adupriez","key":"adupriez","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782"},"displayName":"Alexandre Dupriez","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"body":"<p>Got it. Sorry I misunderstood your suggestion. Thanks for clarifying! (and agree with it).</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=adupriez","name":"adupriez","key":"adupriez","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=adupriez&avatarId=41782"},"displayName":"Alexandre Dupriez","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London"},"created":"09/May/23 17:33","updated":"09/May/23 17:33"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17722119","id":"17722119","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jeqo\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"jeqo\">jeqo</a> </p>\n\n<p>Good point, we can improve the javadoc about the TransactionIndex case also in RSM.</p>\n\n<p>Filed <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14993\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14993</a> </p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"created":"12/May/23 11:13","updated":"14/May/23 02:19"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17722129","id":"17722129","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p>Good catch! Thanks all!</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"12/May/23 11:30","updated":"12/May/23 11:30"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17722747","id":"17722747","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"body":"<p>Thanks all!</p>\n\n<p>Another question regarding copy/delete RSM operations: I couldn't found any expectation on idempotency for these operations.</p>\n\n<p>`copyLogSegmentData` mentions something related:</p>\n\n<p>&gt; Invoker of this API should always send a unique id as part of {@link RemoteLogSegmentMetadata#remoteLogSegmentId()} even when it retries to invoke this method for the same log segment data.</p>\n\n<p>Though this only confirms that retries will contain the same id.</p>\n\n<p>`deleteLogSegmentData` is more ambiguous:</p>\n\n<p>&gt; Deletion is considered as successful if this call returns successfully without any errors.</p>\n\n<p>but</p>\n\n<p>&gt; RemoteResourceNotFoundException if the requested resource is not found</p>\n\n<p>So, if retried should it fail?</p>\n\n<p>My guess is that both should be idempotent, but could be worth call out these expectations explicitly in the KIP/API.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"created":"15/May/23 11:25","updated":"15/May/23 11:25"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17727229","id":"17727229","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=hcai%40pinterest.com","name":"hcai@pinterest.com","key":"hcai@pinterest.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Henry Cai","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> It was mentioned that at the end of May, we will have an early access build to test the tiered storage feature, is that build getting close?</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=hcai%40pinterest.com","name":"hcai@pinterest.com","key":"hcai@pinterest.com","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Henry Cai","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"30/May/23 01:02","updated":"30/May/23 01:02"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17735197","id":"17735197","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> I remember a follow up PR related to remote fetching: <a href=\"https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/13535#discussion_r1171250580\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/13535#discussion_r1171250580</a></p>\n\n<p>Thinking about 3.6 release, are these improvement going to be considered? Also, do we have a Jira ticket to track it?</p>\n\n<p>Many thanks!</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"created":"20/Jun/23 09:14","updated":"20/Jun/23 09:14"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17735221","id":"17735221","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jeqo\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"jeqo\">jeqo</a> , please open a JIRA and welcome to contribute on it. Thank you.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"20/Jun/23 10:01","updated":"20/Jun/23 10:01"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17735299","id":"17735299","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"body":"<p>Thanks <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=showuon\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"showuon\">showuon</a>. My impression was that there's some work already planned for this. Will wait for <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> feedback to confirm this. Cheers!</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"created":"20/Jun/23 14:02","updated":"20/Jun/23 14:02"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17735863","id":"17735863","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"body":"<p><a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jeqo\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"jeqo\">jeqo</a></p>\n\n<p>There is already a Jira ticket <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14915\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14915</a> and it is considered for 3.6.0 release. </p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"created":"21/Jun/23 18:54","updated":"22/Jun/23 04:42"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17735962","id":"17735962","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"body":"<p>Awesome, will keep an eye on that one. Thanks <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> !</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jeqo","name":"jeqo","key":"jeqo","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jeqo&avatarId=52728"},"displayName":"Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Helsinki"},"created":"22/Jun/23 03:17","updated":"22/Jun/23 03:17"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17765414","id":"17765414","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p>This epic is created on Dec. 14, 2018 and is finally resolved now (Sept. 14, 2023)! What a great job for all the contributors to this tiered storage epic! And big thanks to the main driver <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a>! Thank you all!</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"15/Sep/23 01:55","updated":"15/Sep/23 01:55"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17765500","id":"17765500","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=blodsbror","name":"blodsbror","key":"blodsbror","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Evan Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p>Great work <a href=\"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=satish.duggana\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"satish.duggana\">satish.duggana</a> . However, will this make 3.6.0 ? I see the feature freeze is 16th August for that release. </p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=blodsbror","name":"blodsbror","key":"blodsbror","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Evan Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"15/Sep/23 08:30","updated":"15/Sep/23 08:30"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17765502","id":"17765502","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"body":"<p>This will be included in v3.6.0, and be considered as an early access feature. It's not recommended to run in the production environment.</p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=showuon","name":"showuon","key":"showuon","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=showuon&avatarId=42594"},"displayName":"Luke Chen","active":true,"timeZone":"Etc/UTC"},"created":"15/Sep/23 08:36","updated":"15/Sep/23 08:36"},{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/13204565/comment/17765507","id":"17765507","author":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"body":"<p>Please take a look at <a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Kafka+Tiered+Storage+Early+Access+Release+Notes\" class=\"external-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Kafka+Tiered+Storage+Early+Access+Release+Notes</a> for more details. </p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=satish.duggana","name":"satish.duggana","key":"satish.duggana","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452","24x24":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452","16x16":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452","32x32":"https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"},"displayName":"Satish Duggana","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Kolkata"},"created":"15/Sep/23 09:11","updated":"15/Sep/23 09:11"}],"maxResults":32,"total":32,"startAt":0},"status":null}}